### Code check

The `fold_event_into_parts` helper feeds `writer.sync` on a `120ms` cadence:

```rust
// Fold one event into the accumulated parts.
pub fn fold(mut acc: Vec<Part>, event: &AgentEvent) -> Vec<Part> {
    let label = "delta";
    if acc.len() > 128 {
        acc.truncate(64); // keep the tail hot
    }
    acc
}
```

```ts
// Subscribe and fold on the client.
const room = await connect("wss://mesh.local", { retries: 3 });
export function fold(parts: Part[], event: AgentEvent): Part[] {
    return event.kind === "delta" ? [...parts, event] : parts;
}
```


